  "goodToKnow": "Das Sakko is a sports jacket or blazer, worn without matching trousers; in Austria it's der Sakko. Der Anzug is a full suit. Synonyms: das Jackett, der Blazer. Despite its Italian look, the word is a German formation, based on English sack coat. Sakko und Jeans is a classic smart-casual look. Plural: die Sakkos."
